- assert normalized.incomplete is False;
- assert the checkpoint_created event does not become prompt text;
- keep the production implementation unchanged;
- do not modify .entire files, README.md, or unrelated files;
- do not stage, commit, or push.

After editing, run the focused test and the full radar test suite.

